sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as CLI Command Parser
    participant SET as Settings Service
    participant REP as Report Service
    participant TREPO as Transaction Repository
    participant IREPO as Initial Balance Repository

    User->>CLI: report monthly --month 2026-03
    CLI->>SET: Get reportTimezone
    SET-->>CLI: Asia/Jakarta (example)

    CLI->>REP: Build monthly report request(period, month, timezone)
    REP->>TREPO: Load transactions in month bucket (for period totals)
    TREPO-->>REP: monthTransactions

    REP->>TREPO: Load transactions up to month end (for closing balance)
    TREPO-->>REP: cumulativeTransactions

    REP->>IREPO: Get initialBalanceMinor
    IREPO-->>REP: initialBalanceMinor

    REP->>REP: Compute incomeTotalMinor/expenseTotalMinor/netBalanceMinor (month bucket)
    REP->>REP: Compute closingBalanceMinor (cumulative to month end)
    REP->>REP: Rank topCategories by amountMinor DESC, normalized key ASC

    REP-->>CLI: Monthly report contract
    CLI-->>User: Render English monthly summary
